<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:59 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>受大脑启发的随机性使人工视觉更加可靠</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/brain-inspired-randomness-makes-artificial-vision-more-reliable</link><description>即使在恶劣的条件下，人类通常也非常擅长识别物体。相比之下，人工视觉系统会更快地达到极限。赫蒂临床大脑研究所的研究人员现在已经研究了人工视觉系统可以从大脑中学习什么。他们发现，结合两种受大脑启发的特征可以使图像识别更加可靠。研究结果是&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/brain-inspired-randomness-makes-artificial-vision-more-reliable2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:19:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/brain-inspired-randomness-makes-artificial-vision-more-reliable</guid></item><item><title>微生物-胆汁酸轴介导女性免受慢性肝病的保护</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-microbiome-bile-acid-axis-mediates-protection-from-chronic-liver-disease-in-females</link><description>IsoUDCA 是一种富含雌性的胆汁酸，由受雌激素青睐的肠道细菌群产生，通过 SREBP2- 促进肝脏胆固醇处理和胆汁酸代谢。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-microbiome-bile-acid-axis-mediates-protection-from-chronic-liver-disease-in-females2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:04:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-microbiome-bile-acid-axis-mediates-protection-from-chronic-liver-disease-in-females</guid></item><item><title>软件开发中的人工智能革命</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-ai-revolution-in-software-development</link><description>了解最优秀的公司如何利用先进技术、科技和人工智能解决方案推动人工智能转型，释放价值。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-ai-revolution-in-software-development2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:49:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-ai-revolution-in-software-development</guid></item><item><title>我们即将解开中微子最大的谜团吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/are-we-about-to-solve-the-greatest-mystery-of-the-neutrino</link><description>长期以来，我们一直有一个关于中微子的看似简单的问题：它们有多重？现在，中国的一项大型实验即将揭晓答案——答案可能永远改变粒子物理学&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/are-we-about-to-solve-the-greatest-mystery-of-the-neutrino2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:34:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/are-we-about-to-solve-the-greatest-mystery-of-the-neutrino</guid></item><item><title>Longeveron 的干细胞数据暗示大脑更平静</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/longeverons-stem-cell-data-hint-at-calmer-brains</link><description>正当该公司踏上投资者之旅之际，一份新的预印本将该公司的细胞疗法与减少阿尔茨海默氏症的脑部炎症联系起来。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/longeverons-stem-cell-data-hint-at-calmer-brains.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:19:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/longeverons-stem-cell-data-hint-at-calmer-brains</guid></item><item><title>研究表明，新的人工智能工具可以通过单个患者的自拍照来预测癌症生存率</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/new-ai-tool-can-predict-cancer-survival-by-a-single-patient-selfie-study-suggests</link><description>这是迄今为止最全面的演示之一，展示了人工智能对自拍照的分析如何帮助评估患者的健康状况并有可能指导他们的医疗护理，并且接受了来自不同种族和年龄的超过 4000 万张面部照片的数据的训练。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-ai-tool-can-predict-cancer-survival-by-a-single-patient-selfie-study-suggests2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:04:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/new-ai-tool-can-predict-cancer-survival-by-a-single-patient-selfie-study-suggests</guid></item><item><title>推进低资源编程语言的编码</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/advancing-coding-in-low-resource-programming-languages</link><description>COBOL 开发人员正在成为迁移审核员。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/advancing-coding-in-low-resource-programming-languages.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:49:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/advancing-coding-in-low-resource-programming-languages</guid></item><item><title>现在可以在实验室中检测到单个原子碰撞，这有可能为新物理学开辟道路</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/individual-atomic-collisions-can-now-be-detected-in-the-lab-potentially-opening-up-pathways-to-new-physics</link><description>我们周围的微小原子和分子不断地相互轰击。虽然我们定期测量这些相互作用的大规模影响，但测量每次单独碰撞的影响要困难得多。但现在，研究人员已经成功地在实验室中测量了微小气体颗粒如何影响单个二氧化硅颗粒。在他们的新研究中， &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/individual-atomic-collisions-can-now-be-detected-in-the-lab-potentially-opening-up-pathways-to-new-physics.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:34:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/individual-atomic-collisions-can-now-be-detected-in-the-lab-potentially-opening-up-pathways-to-new-physics</guid></item><item><title>麻省理工学院的 Claude Opus 4.7 实验凸显了人工智能自主学习的潜力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mits-claude-opus-4-7-experiment-highlights-ai-self-directed-learning-potential</link><description>麻省理工学院的 Claude Opus 4.7 实验展示了人工智能自主学习的潜力。到 2026 年 10 月，Google 拥有最好的 AI 模型，支持率为 70.6%。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mits-claude-opus-4-7-experiment-highlights-ai-self-directed-learning-potential.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:19:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/mits-claude-opus-4-7-experiment-highlights-ai-self-directed-learning-potential</guid></item><item><title>美国超导智能芯片以创纪录的速度分析聚变等离子体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/us-superconducting-smart-chip-analyzes-fusion-plasma-at-record-speeds</link><description>纽约州的科学家创造了一种首创的超导神经芯片，据报道每秒可以处理约一百万个融合等离子体样本。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/us-superconducting-smart-chip-analyzes-fusion-plasma-at-record-speeds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:04:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/us-superconducting-smart-chip-analyzes-fusion-plasma-at-record-speeds</guid></item></channel></rss>